# Ox SDD feature index

Features in this directory are independent and remain directly under
`sdd/features/` according to the adopted SDD 1.3.0 validator.

## Historical governance

- `adoption-governance`: library and authority adoption.
- `governance-externalization`: removal of external-study dependencies.

Historical results remain in the baseline. Affected active envelopes receive new
observations according to evidence.md; old hashes are not reused.

## Governance tools

- `governance-layout`: tools in tools/governance/, configuration in
  config/governance/; the historical reservation of src/ was superseded by
  `application/` in ADR `docs/decisions/product-bootstrap.md`.

## Skill library

- `skill-*`: authoring, routing and evaluation of the nine specializations.
- Technical criteria requiring actual subsystems remain UNVERIFIED when there
  is no implementation evidence.

## Ox product

- `product-foundation`: phase transition and verifiable foundation preparation.
- `product-bootstrap`: virtual workspace in application/, 16 crates and Iced shell;
  per-crate sources/tests and separate evidence (outside the governance package).
- Future `product-*`: functionality of Rust/Iced modules, plugins, runtime, context,
  graphs, verification and other capabilities, each with its own evidence.

The local route follows `sdd/workflow.md`. Do not move features to evade gates,
promote historical approvals or confuse documentation with implementation.

## Current decision preparation — 2026-11-01

- `product-f0-gate`: documentary reconciliation and operational gate proposal; completion of this documentation does not complete F0.
- `product-local-persistence`: proposed requirements and storage ADR, with implementation awaiting explicit maintainer authorization.
- Nine specialization T004 tasks now reflect the recorded bounded-consumer executions; product acceptance remains separate.
